{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:83156","published":"2026-10-14T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-10-19T14:42:21.528720592Z","related":["CVE-2026-46319","CVE-2026-53011","CVE-2026-64030","CVE-2026-68140","CVE-2026-68377","CVE-2026-68404","CVE-2026-68409","CVE-2026-72262","CVE-2026-72288","CVE-2026-72320","CVE-2026-74641","CVE-2026-74705","CVE-2026-80985","CVE-2026-81003","CVE-2026-89526","CVE-2026-90036","CVE-2026-93207","CVE-2026-93228"],"summary":"Important: kernel security update","details":"The kernel packages contain the Linux kernel, the core of any Linux operating system.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * kernel: net/sched: act_ct: Only release RCU read lock after ct_ft (CVE-2026-46319)\n  * kernel: net/sched: taprio: fix use-after-free in advance_sched() on schedule switch (CVE-2026-53011)\n  * kernel: wifi: mac80211: bounds-check link_id in ieee80211_ml_epcs (CVE-2026-64030)\n  * kernel: wifi: cfg80211: use wiphy work for socket owner autodisconnect (CVE-2026-68404)\n  * kernel: Linux kernel: Denial of Service due to use-after-free in act_tunnel_key (CVE-2026-68377)\n  * kernel: net/iucv: fix use-after-free of a severed iucv_path (CVE-2026-68140)\n  * kernel: wifi: mac80211: defer link RX stats percpu free to RCU (CVE-2026-68409)\n  * kernel: KVM: arm64: vgic: Handle race between interrupt affinity change and LPI disabling (CVE-2026-72288)\n  * kernel: ASoC: SOF: ipc3-control: Fix heap overflow in bytes_ext put/get (CVE-2026-72262)\n  * kernel: netfilter: nft_lookup: fix catchall element handling with inverted lookups (CVE-2026-72320)\n  * kernel: ALSA: usx2y: bound the hwdep mmap fault offset (CVE-2026-74641)\n  * kernel: udp: fix potential use-after-free in tunnel segmentation (CVE-2026-74705)\n  * kernel: net/smc: carry oversized SMC-Rv2 LLC messages in the queue entry (CVE-2026-80985)\n  * kernel: svcrdma: Validate Read chunk positions before reconstruction (CVE-2026-89526)\n  * kernel: net/iucv: filter frames in afiucv_hs_rcv() by ingress device (CVE-2026-81003)\n  * kernel: NFSD: Prevent client use-after-free during blocked-lock reaping (CVE-2026-90036)\n  * kernel: SUNRPC: Zero rpc_gss_wire_cred at svcauth_gss_decode_credbody() entry (CVE-2026-93207)\n  * kernel: svcrdma: Reject Write/Reply chunks with segcount 0 (CVE-2026-93228)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kernel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5.14.0-687.58.1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:83156.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-64k","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-64k"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5.14.0-687.58.1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:83156.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-64k-core","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-64k-core"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5.14.0-687.58.1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:83156.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-64k-debug","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-64k-debug"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5.14.0-687.58.1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:83156.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-64k-debug-core","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-64k-debug-core"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5.14.0